<h2 id="core-features">Core Features</h2>
<p>Guinevere delivers everything you need for modern GUI development:</p>
<h3 id="performance-first">Performance First</h3>
<ul>
<li>Zero-allocation rendering where possible</li>
<li>Optimized draw call batching</li>
<li>Minimal CPU overhead</li>
<li>GPU-accelerated rendering</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="developer-experience">Developer Experience</h3>
<ul>
<li>Immediate mode paradigm</li>
<li>No complex state management</li>
<li>Hot reload support</li>
<li>Comprehensive debugging tools</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="rich-controls">Rich Controls</h3>
<ul>
<li>Standard UI elements (buttons, inputs, sliders)</li>
<li>Advanced layouts (flex, grid, absolute)</li>
<li>Custom drawing primitives</li>
<li>Theme and styling system</li>
</ul>
